## Elongated Emerald Cut Diamond Engagement Ring: Natural Stones

![Natural elongated emerald cut diamond price ladder — 1ct to 3ct GIA certified, stone price vs ring total, clarity and color grades](/images/elongated-emerald-cut-diamond-prices.avif)

A natural elongated emerald cut diamond requires VS1 minimum clarity at every carat weight. The step-cut facets are transparent — the open table shows inclusions that a brilliant cut would scatter and hide. Below VS1, an emerald cut's inclusions are visible to the naked eye from normal viewing distance.

This is not a debate. It is the defining characteristic of the step-cut format.

