The [GIA 1.5ct E-VS1 at $10,409](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29298663?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is where the elongated emerald cut makes its most dramatic statement in natural. At 1.5ct and 1.45+ L:W, the stone measures approximately 8.5mm long — longer than most 2ct round brilliants. This is where The Face-Up Illusion becomes tangible rather than theoretical.

